OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrests over baby girl's
OL,4,Adeath in woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll four were detained at the scene and
OL,7,Fhave since been bailed while inquiries
OL,8,Fcontinue, Staffordshire Police said.
